  "an3.100:2.1": "",
  "an3.100:2.2": "According to <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn36'>MN 36</a>, this means that pleasure can invade this individual’s mind and remain there. Again according to <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn36'>MN 36</a>, this means that pain can invade this individual’s mind and remain there.",
  "an3.100:2.3": "",
  "an3.100:3.1": "",
  "an3.100:3.2": "Immeasurable concentration. See AN 3:65 <i>(PTS—AN 3:66).</i>",
